(4101211, 588566, 83313, '<td valign="top">Something that has no doubt been photographed a bazillion time, but you captured a unique view of it. I like the mist. At least I hope that''s mist and not smog.</td>', 'Something that has no doubt been photographed a bazillion time, but you captured a unique view of it. I like the mist. At least I hope that''s mist and not smog.', '2007-09-19 09:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
