(4101219, 588845, 84286, '<td valign="top">too much light on the front of the subject, thus not a silhouette in my book.  The details of the subject should not be visible at all, IMHO.  From the dictionary "the dark shape and outline of someone or something visible against a lighter background, esp. in dim light."  I suspect if you dimmed the light in the back even further it might have helped.</td>', 'too much light on the front of the subject, thus not a silhouette in my book.  The details of the subject should not be visible at all, IMHO.  From the dictionary "the dark shape and outline of someone or something visible against a lighter background, esp. in dim light."  I suspect if you dimmed the light in the back even further it might have helped.', '2007-09-19 09:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4101220, 588540, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this just looks like a snapshot to me. The blown out highlights in the window are drawing my eye away from the subject.</td>', 'Sorry, this just looks like a snapshot to me. The blown out highlights in the window are drawing my eye away from the subject.', '2007-09-19 09:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
