(4105779, 588399, 77196, '<td valign="top">This would have been an incredible shot if you could have captured the full body in silhouette. Nice lighting, and I like the pattern on the sail. The "banding" in the sky (visible edges instead of a smooth transition from one tone to another) detracts from the shot.</td>', 'This would have been an incredible shot if you could have captured the full body in silhouette. Nice lighting, and I like the pattern on the sail. The "banding" in the sky (visible edges instead of a smooth transition from one tone to another) detracts from the shot.', '2007-09-20 21:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
