(4106084, 587617, 15711, '<td valign="top">If this were black and white I''d think it was <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nixter</a> or <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=41047" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sevilduvarci</a>.<br/> <br/>Well, whoever did it, I like it. ;~D</td>', 'If this were black and white I''d think it was  nixter or  sevilduvarci. Well, whoever did it, I like it. ;~D', '2007-09-21 00:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
