(4106093, 588939, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks a touch forced by adjusting levels or curves. I think for it to really work, I''d have just done the heads like one of those old fashioned cut outs you see in oval frames in a Victorian parlor. WIth just their faces blacked out, it seems a touch off to me. Hope this is helpful. ;~D</td>', 'Looks a touch forced by adjusting levels or curves. I think for it to really work, I''d have just done the heads like one of those old fashioned cut outs you see in oval frames in a Victorian parlor. WIth just their faces blacked out, it seems a touch off to me. Hope this is helpful. ;~D', '2007-09-21 00:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4106096, 588441, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the clouds - they almost give it a 3-D cardboard cut out feeling. I like it.</td>', 'Very nice. Love the clouds - they almost give it a 3-D cardboard cut out feeling. I like it.', '2007-09-21 00:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4106124, 588854, 84465, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  The feel of the shot is really cool and crisp which the blue overlay helps.  I love the blue mountains in the distance. The clouds are also very unique and help balance the shot.  The road helps to lead my eye into the image and into the lake and the beautiful scenery. Great shot</td>', 'I love this shot!  The feel of the shot is really cool and crisp which the blue overlay helps.  I love the blue mountains in the distance. The clouds are also very unique and help balance the shot.  The road helps to lead my eye into the image and into the lake and the beautiful scenery. Great shot', '2007-09-21 00:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4106126, 586339, 84465, '<td valign="top">This is a unique shot.  I can''t really tell what the subject is but it is very well silhoutted against the background which is my favorite part of the piece.  The yellow overlay works well and helps add the warm feeling to the shot.  Good work</td>', 'This is a unique shot.  I can''t really tell what the subject is but it is very well silhoutted against the background which is my favorite part of the piece.  The yellow overlay works well and helps add the warm feeling to the shot.  Good work', '2007-09-21 00:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
