(4107835, 588653, 22970, '<td valign="top">A nice "nigh-shot" photograph done very well but, IMO, does not comply with the theme of the challenge. I guess I could say the three''s in the water was a silhouette but they''re a reflection. The first bridge is lit so I''m guessing that the middle bridge is the silhouette in your picture. Taking that into account I will not say you did not meet the challenge but I feel you did not do it well. Again your photograph is very nice. I love the warm tones and the reflections in the canal. I just wish there were more of a presents of silhouette. Wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'A nice "nigh-shot" photograph done very well but, IMO, does not comply with the theme of the challenge. I guess I could say the three''s in the water was a silhouette but they''re a reflection. The first bridge is lit so I''m guessing that the middle bridge is the silhouette in your picture. Taking that into account I will not say you did not meet the challenge but I feel you did not do it well. Again your photograph is very nice. I love the warm tones and the reflections in the canal. I just wish there were more of a presents of silhouette. Wish you well in the challenge.', '2007-09-21 21:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
