(4107867, 588073, 22970, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene but the dark top that curves downward to the right and the the bottom dark area are distracting. I think bringing the reflective ground to the bottom of the photograph would of been a better solution. Also the side of building where the sun is half hidden splits the photograph down the middle. I think a better composition could have been achieved with this shot making it more appealing. I do find the tone and the city building along with the Crane in background interesting.</td>', 'Interesting scene but the dark top that curves downward to the right and the the bottom dark area are distracting. I think bringing the reflective ground to the bottom of the photograph would of been a better solution. Also the side of building where the sun is half hidden splits the photograph down the middle. I think a better composition could have been achieved with this shot making it more appealing. I do find the tone and the city building along with the Crane in background interesting.', '2007-09-21 22:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
