(4108550, 587082, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nice but if it had been mine, I''d have cropped it (maybe square - but that''s my choice) and concentrated more on the bird. The curve of his neck and his bill really is interesting and all of the trees just clutter it up in my opinion.  The silhouette is crisp and sharp against the sky, so I think I''d concentrate on the bird a bit more. ;~D</td>', 'Really nice but if it had been mine, I''d have cropped it (maybe square - but that''s my choice) and concentrated more on the bird. The curve of his neck and his bill really is interesting and all of the trees just clutter it up in my opinion.  The silhouette is crisp and sharp against the sky, so I think I''d concentrate on the bird a bit more. ;~D', '2007-09-22 10:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108554, 586531, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this.  If it were mine, I''d crop to the left of the lamp post and to the right of the tree trunk, creating more of a vignette and not so many busy shapes. Does that make sense? As it is, there is no place for the eye to rest and it seems a bit cluttered. I wish the silhouettes were a touch more crisp.</td>', 'I like the idea of this.  If it were mine, I''d crop to the left of the lamp post and to the right of the tree trunk, creating more of a vignette and not so many busy shapes. Does that make sense? As it is, there is no place for the eye to rest and it seems a bit cluttered. I wish the silhouettes were a touch more crisp.', '2007-09-22 10:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108555, 587831, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for a horse every time!!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for a horse every time!!', '2007-09-22 10:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108556, 587831, 80841, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful.</td>', 'This is really beautiful.', '2007-09-22 10:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108557, 587925, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love her curls and the backlit wisps of hair. I might''ve cropped a touch tighter, deleting the tree to the left of the rooftop, or maybe even the rooftop all together, and the hint of shrub in the lower right.  It''s a touch busy as it is, but I love that we can tell she''s smiling.</td>', 'Love her curls and the backlit wisps of hair. I might''ve cropped a touch tighter, deleting the tree to the left of the rooftop, or maybe even the rooftop all together, and the hint of shrub in the lower right.  It''s a touch busy as it is, but I love that we can tell she''s smiling.', '2007-09-22 10:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108562, 588405, 15711, '<td valign="top">SOMEBODY GOT NEKKID!!!  This is reminiscent of photos my mom (yeah, this sounds weird) did when she was newly married, and my dad was in the Air Force in WWII. I don''t know why I felt like telling you this, but when an image brings a memory, I think it''s nice to share. ANYWAY - I do like it.  The silhouette is crisp and the idea is well executed. A nice change from shrubs and sunsets. 8</td>', 'SOMEBODY GOT NEKKID!!!  This is reminiscent of photos my mom (yeah, this sounds weird) did when she was newly married, and my dad was in the Air Force in WWII. I don''t know why I felt like telling you this, but when an image brings a memory, I think it''s nice to share. ANYWAY - I do like it.  The silhouette is crisp and the idea is well executed. A nice change from shrubs and sunsets. 8', '2007-09-22 10:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4108564, 588550, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that kitty.  Something about it is appealing to me. Love the whiskers. I wonder if it had a more crisp line, if it would go over better. Hmmm. not sure, just thinking out loud.</td>', 'Oh that kitty.  Something about it is appealing to me. Love the whiskers. I wonder if it had a more crisp line, if it would go over better. Hmmm. not sure, just thinking out loud.', '2007-09-22 10:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
