(4111796, 588803, 69776, '<td valign="top">nice focus and great story telling. nice job</td>', 'nice focus and great story telling. nice job', '2007-09-24 04:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4111893, 588657, 30982, '<td valign="top">This rocks.  The depth is amazing and the bit of mist in the distance seals the deal.<br/>(Just noticed that due to sporadic internet connections, my comment was severely truncated before - sorry about that!)</td>', 'This rocks.  The depth is amazing and the bit of mist in the distance seals the deal.(Just noticed that due to sporadic internet connections, my comment was severely truncated before - sorry about that!)', '2007-09-24 07:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112065, 588961, 75034, '<td valign="top">A woman with child is a great subject for just about any challenge but in silhouette it is even better. Nice shot I''ll wager the subject was happy with the results.</td>', 'A woman with child is a great subject for just about any challenge but in silhouette it is even better. Nice shot I''ll wager the subject was happy with the results.', '2007-09-24 09:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112164, 588147, 75034, '<td valign="top">Is this a coal fired power plant? If it is you have caught the next trend in the political arena. Going dark by way of shut down. Nice capture.</td>', 'Is this a coal fired power plant? If it is you have caught the next trend in the political arena. Going dark by way of shut down. Nice capture.', '2007-09-24 10:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112165, 588742, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice shot here you were in the right place at the right time and it payed off for you nice work.</td>', 'Nice shot here you were in the right place at the right time and it payed off for you nice work.', '2007-09-24 10:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112166, 588497, 75034, '<td valign="top">the contrast in the sky is lovely and the trees set off the lower part of your photo. The main subject is an interesting subject for this challenge. It is nice to see people take a step out of the norm.</td>', 'the contrast in the sky is lovely and the trees set off the lower part of your photo. The main subject is an interesting subject for this challenge. It is nice to see people take a step out of the norm.', '2007-09-24 10:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112167, 588414, 75034, '<td valign="top">NIce set up you could stand to loose the objects above the sheet and a tighter crop would work better. Nice effort.</td>', 'NIce set up you could stand to loose the objects above the sheet and a tighter crop would work better. Nice effort.', '2007-09-24 10:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112168, 588716, 75034, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked hard to see the Silhouette in this shot and am hard pressed at best to find it. Maybe you are too clever for me here. The bokeh however is lovely.</td>', 'I''ve looked hard to see the Silhouette in this shot and am hard pressed at best to find it. Maybe you are too clever for me here. The bokeh however is lovely.', '2007-09-24 10:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112181, 588222, 75034, '<td valign="top">I was trapped at the top of a fariswheel once for a very long time. You have brought back some painful memories from my childhood. I hope your happy:-}<br/>OK I''m over it now. I like the reflected light as the means of silhouette for this as opposed to the sun it would have been to hard to make out the finer details.</td>', 'I was trapped at the top of a fariswheel once for a very long time. You have brought back some painful memories from my childhood. I hope your happy:-}OK I''m over it now. I like the reflected light as the means of silhouette for this as opposed to the sun it would have been to hard to make out the finer details.', '2007-09-24 10:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112195, 588267, 75034, '<td valign="top">OK I''m not much of a farmer but I''m farely sure that I''m looking at wheat or at least some kind of grass but not corn ears. If this is some kink of new corn that I''ve never seen befor I''m sorry. Please fill me in on this, this could be the next wonder crop.<br/>That being said you have done a nice job of your silhouette. I like the contrast of colours and the warm sun at the bottom right of your photo. Nice work.</td>', 'OK I''m not much of a farmer but I''m farely sure that I''m looking at wheat or at least some kind of grass but not corn ears. If this is some kink of new corn that I''ve never seen befor I''m sorry. Please fill me in on this, this could be the next wonder crop.That being said you have done a nice job of your silhouette. I like the contrast of colours and the warm sun at the bottom right of your photo. Nice work.', '2007-09-24 10:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112204, 588654, 75034, '<td valign="top">Is this in Holland. They seam to be a very progressive country. The shot is well composed and the short to tall effect works well and was a good choice.<br/>The colour of the sky is wonderful nice shot.</td>', 'Is this in Holland. They seam to be a very progressive country. The shot is well composed and the short to tall effect works well and was a good choice.The colour of the sky is wonderful nice shot.', '2007-09-24 10:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112227, 588772, 75034, '<td valign="top">The lighting is wonderful. Green is as good as any to back light but not all of us have the chance to catch this wonderful back drop well met and a great capture. It is nice thinking outside the box. Hope you do well with this.</td>', 'The lighting is wonderful. Green is as good as any to back light but not all of us have the chance to catch this wonderful back drop well met and a great capture. It is nice thinking outside the box. Hope you do well with this.', '2007-09-24 11:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112230, 588453, 75034, '<td valign="top">Your shot is grainy and blown out on my monitor. It lacks deffinition and focus even in silhouette. It was anice try at something different.</td>', 'Your shot is grainy and blown out on my monitor. It lacks deffinition and focus even in silhouette. It was anice try at something different.', '2007-09-24 11:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112266, 588735, 39679, '<td valign="top">Excellent job of bringing the eye to your subject by using the tree''s as a frame.</td>', 'Excellent job of bringing the eye to your subject by using the tree''s as a frame.', '2007-09-24 11:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112268, 588521, 39679, '<td valign="top">You''re making me seriously miss Newcastle</td>', 'You''re making me seriously miss Newcastle', '2007-09-24 11:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112327, 588297, 66038, '<td valign="top">That''s the best way to see Cleveland...from afar.<br/>  Seriously though, nice color in the sky but something, the darkness perhaps, keeps distracting me. I give it a 6.</td>', 'That''s the best way to see Cleveland...from afar.  Seriously though, nice color in the sky but something, the darkness perhaps, keeps distracting me. I give it a 6.', '2007-09-24 12:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112360, 588961, 42495, '<td valign="top">I really like the silhouette you have here.  The black on white works well and the composition is well done.  A couple minor improvements IMO would be to have the background all white without the dark smudges.  Also, the reflection on the model''s glasses are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I really like the silhouette you have here.  The black on white works well and the composition is well done.  A couple minor improvements IMO would be to have the background all white without the dark smudges.  Also, the reflection on the model''s glasses are a bit distracting.', '2007-09-24 12:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112426, 588721, 66038, '<td valign="top">What beautiful colors. I love the tones.</td>', 'What beautiful colors. I love the tones.', '2007-09-24 13:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112434, 588064, 13648, '<td valign="top">Subjects too small to grab the eye</td>', 'Subjects too small to grab the eye', '2007-09-24 13:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112444, 588742, 84577, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal cloud formation! Excellent use of camera settings to get the most out of the environment! It''s a rare (and brief) treat to see the air currents twist clouds around mountains like this, especially with the cloud density you were able to capture.</td>', 'Phenomenal cloud formation! Excellent use of camera settings to get the most out of the environment! It''s a rare (and brief) treat to see the air currents twist clouds around mountains like this, especially with the cloud density you were able to capture.', '2007-09-24 13:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112528, 588653, 75034, '<td valign="top">Beautiful skyline and nice reflection in the water makes for a nice silhouette</td>', 'Beautiful skyline and nice reflection in the water makes for a nice silhouette', '2007-09-24 13:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112533, 588650, 75034, '<td valign="top">I like the reverse silhouette with the passage way and the bench.</td>', 'I like the reverse silhouette with the passage way and the bench.', '2007-09-24 13:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112535, 588814, 43548, '<td valign="top">even though the silhouette is not very clear i love this.</td>', 'even though the silhouette is not very clear i love this.', '2007-09-24 13:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4112540, 588655, 75034, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours and the contrast between the land, boat and pier works well together. Nice capture.</td>', 'Very nice colours and the contrast between the land, boat and pier works well together. Nice capture.', '2007-09-24 13:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
