(4112546, 587451, 43548, '<td valign="top">this is one of my favorites, it reminds me of the old fashioned silhouettes, like cameos, but you made it playful and interesting with the hair. i like it alot</td>', 'this is one of my favorites, it reminds me of the old fashioned silhouettes, like cameos, but you made it playful and interesting with the hair. i like it alot', '2007-09-24 13:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
