(4112558, 588213, 75034, '<td valign="top">The sun is beautiful with the three colours shining off it. My attention was drawen to the hot pixel just to the lower left of the sun. No big deal though.<br/>The overall composition of the shot with the water in the forground is a nice touch. Well done.</td>', 'The sun is beautiful with the three colours shining off it. My attention was drawen to the hot pixel just to the lower left of the sun. No big deal though.The overall composition of the shot with the water in the forground is a nice touch. Well done.', '2007-09-24 14:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
