(4116326, 588802, 68504, '<td valign="top">Boy you did get hammered.  I thought this very interesting (haven''t reviewed the top 2/3 entries yet).  On the one hand it might be too subtle for the many (always enjoy thinking that);  on the other, your desaturation may miss a little of the possible finesse of more complicated BW conversion. (Looked at your photos on profile page and your colour photos are all spot on). Just a suggestion.  The composition, subject and framing are really fine.</td>', 'Boy you did get hammered.  I thought this very interesting (haven''t reviewed the top 2/3 entries yet).  On the one hand it might be too subtle for the many (always enjoy thinking that);  on the other, your desaturation may miss a little of the possible finesse of more complicated BW conversion. (Looked at your photos on profile page and your colour photos are all spot on). Just a suggestion.  The composition, subject and framing are really fine.', '2007-09-26 02:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
