(4116598, 588772, 33535, '<td valign="top">I''d suggest that this green haze are''nt northern lights, it''s just clouds beeing illuminated from the light of a town or something. i know how northern lights look like and would be pretty surprised if these are really northern lights (i''ve seen the first aurora activity in iceland around this time of the year but not as strong as this seems)...but tell me a lesson if you can...;-)<br/> <br/>anyways, congrats on the top 10, it''s an awesome scene!</td>', 'I''d suggest that this green haze are''nt northern lights, it''s just clouds beeing illuminated from the light of a town or something. i know how northern lights look like and would be pretty surprised if these are really northern lights (i''ve seen the first aurora activity in iceland around this time of the year but not as strong as this seems)...but tell me a lesson if you can...;-) anyways, congrats on the top 10, it''s an awesome scene!', '2007-09-26 06:10:37.000000', NULL, 0),
