(4116770, 588727, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kelvinyam:</b></div><hr/><i> This shall be a nice shot, but it looks like an over processed photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I wouldn''t say I OVER processed it? Maybe this is what killed me lol I just brought the vibrance and blacks up in lightroom! Altho I wonder if the other version would''ve scored better...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-26 07:40:07.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by kelvinyam: This shall be a nice shot, but it looks like an over processed photo.  I wouldn''t say I OVER processed it? Maybe this is what killed me lol I just brought the vibrance and blacks up in lightroom! Altho I wonder if the other version would''ve scored better...', '2007-09-26 08:38:02.000000', '2007-09-26 08:40:07.000000', 0),
