(4116779, 588727, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Love the people and cars, which I suspect are things others may not like in this.  Gives it life and energy.  Great capture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks alot!!!! =)</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Love the people and cars, which I suspect are things others may not like in this.  Gives it life and energy.  Great capture.   Thanks alot!!!! =)', '2007-09-26 08:41:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116780, 588831, 67883, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is a winning entry, by far. I don''t like the composition or the movement. You are cropping the image at odd places. The colors are ok but a little flat. <br/> <br/>What I like about it is that it is a good moment and silhouette.<br/> <br/>I would think that something like 5.5 would be fair for this one.</td>', 'I don''t think this is a winning entry, by far. I don''t like the composition or the movement. You are cropping the image at odd places. The colors are ok but a little flat.  What I like about it is that it is a good moment and silhouette. I would think that something like 5.5 would be fair for this one.', '2007-09-26 08:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116789, 588760, 67883, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool moment, but like others said it just lacks outlines. I can''t really distinguish that this is a whole person, your focus is all on the top of the image which makes this a really odd composition and not pleasing to look at. If you would have backed up some more and tried a different angle to get more of the outlines of the person you would have gotten better results I think. Also you don''t need to use the bright sun like this to get a silhouette, could just use the warm colored sky, as the sun overexposes the top of the image and makes a ugly mark on the sword.</td>', 'It''s a cool moment, but like others said it just lacks outlines. I can''t really distinguish that this is a whole person, your focus is all on the top of the image which makes this a really odd composition and not pleasing to look at. If you would have backed up some more and tried a different angle to get more of the outlines of the person you would have gotten better results I think. Also you don''t need to use the bright sun like this to get a silhouette, could just use the warm colored sky, as the sun overexposes the top of the image and makes a ugly mark on the sword.', '2007-09-26 08:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116796, 587699, 72670, '<td valign="top">Soo close!! I really love this tree. I never get tired of seeing it. <br/>Congrats!!</td>', 'Soo close!! I really love this tree. I never get tired of seeing it. Congrats!!', '2007-09-26 08:55:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116797, 588879, 80058, '<td valign="top">Congrats lovely shot, well done!!!!!!!!!!! ;)</td>', 'Congrats lovely shot, well done!!!!!!!!!!! ;)', '2007-09-26 08:55:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116798, 588845, 3746, '<td valign="top">You dont seem to be having a very good run at the moment!</td>', 'You dont seem to be having a very good run at the moment!', '2007-09-26 08:56:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116800, 588879, 56744, '<td valign="top">Sean,<br/>I''ve no words to express my happyness when I saw you at the first page.<br/>You deserved this cause you have been working hard and this wonderful photograph shows that a good photographer is made of two things. A good eye for composition and the capacity to work hard to improve his skills. Congrats dude! I knew this was going to happen ;)<br/>P*A*R*A*B*E*N*S!</td>', 'Sean,I''ve no words to express my happyness when I saw you at the first page.You deserved this cause you have been working hard and this wonderful photograph shows that a good photographer is made of two things. A good eye for composition and the capacity to work hard to improve his skills. Congrats dude! I knew this was going to happen ;)P*A*R*A*B*E*N*S!', '2007-09-26 08:57:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116801, 588806, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hotpasta:</b></div><hr/><i> I would have to say this should be in the top 5 or better...I love everything about it except the head chop...9 from me </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow I am glad you got 2nd CONGRATULATIONS, this has been a great surprise to me because I thought people were going to under rated due the crop!!!!!!!!! <br/> <br/>Well done, well deserved ribbon!!</td>', 'Originally posted by hotpasta: I would have to say this should be in the top 5 or better...I love everything about it except the head chop...9 from me   Wow I am glad you got 2nd CONGRATULATIONS, this has been a great surprise to me because I thought people were going to under rated due the crop!!!!!!!!!  Well done, well deserved ribbon!!', '2007-09-26 08:58:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116805, 586496, 80058, '<td valign="top">One of my faves, glad to see it on the top 10!! =)</td>', 'One of my faves, glad to see it on the top 10!! =)', '2007-09-26 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116810, 588657, 66597, '<td valign="top">Alex, you got robbed on this one. The sense of depth provided by the long shadows is exceptional. I was one of your 9''s. Wonderful work!</td>', 'Alex, you got robbed on this one. The sense of depth provided by the long shadows is exceptional. I was one of your 9''s. Wonderful work!', '2007-09-26 09:05:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116819, 587401, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  I knew it was to out-of-the-box, but it was better than the trolled score.  BTW, the owls colors are right on.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  I knew it was to out-of-the-box, but it was better than the trolled score.  BTW, the owls colors are right on.', '2007-09-26 09:08:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116824, 588213, 63398, '<td valign="top">Vastly underrated. Very nice image. I like the understated figures in the water.</td>', 'Vastly underrated. Very nice image. I like the understated figures in the water.', '2007-09-26 09:10:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116825, 587338, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hey, welcome back!  I do love the silhouette but I have to say my fave parts are the street lamp and the light reflecting on the building on the right.  Nice to see some work in color from you lol.</td>', 'Hey, welcome back!  I do love the silhouette but I have to say my fave parts are the street lamp and the light reflecting on the building on the right.  Nice to see some work in color from you lol.', '2007-09-26 09:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116840, 588545, 63398, '<td valign="top">Deb, I thought that this was a terrific image. I''m at a loss to explain why it didn''t do better. I love the brilliant sun.......it''s actually much harder to get a good silhouette with this much light. Nicely done, IMO.</td>', 'Deb, I thought that this was a terrific image. I''m at a loss to explain why it didn''t do better. I love the brilliant sun.......it''s actually much harder to get a good silhouette with this much light. Nicely done, IMO.', '2007-09-26 09:14:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116867, 587082, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job Julianne. Good use of dead space.</td>', 'Nice job Julianne. Good use of dead space.', '2007-09-26 09:23:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116871, 588545, 23484, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sunset Deb. I was stunned when I saw the score but then the challenge is silhouette and that probably explains it.  If you have any outtakes, you might want to enter one in Free Study.  Great shot.</td>', 'Fantastic sunset Deb. I was stunned when I saw the score but then the challenge is silhouette and that probably explains it.  If you have any outtakes, you might want to enter one in Free Study.  Great shot.', '2007-09-26 09:25:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116873, 588441, 11920, '<td valign="top">Well goes to show how much I know. Still love ya though.</td>', 'Well goes to show how much I know. Still love ya though.', '2007-09-26 09:26:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116880, 587991, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot Terry and the color is great. I think it would be neat if the bird and fence were darker though. JMO. Very well composed.</td>', 'Very nice shot Terry and the color is great. I think it would be neat if the bird and fence were darker though. JMO. Very well composed.', '2007-09-26 09:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116883, 587798, 37719, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph!  Excellent composition and balance.  I love the implied symmetry between clouds and trees and fog/mist and trees.  Very well done!  Congrats on a top 20 finish.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph!  Excellent composition and balance.  I love the implied symmetry between clouds and trees and fog/mist and trees.  Very well done!  Congrats on a top 20 finish.', '2007-09-26 09:29:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116884, 588941, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very cool OOB silhouette. It has a touch of the skewsme feel to it (evil). Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool OOB silhouette. It has a touch of the skewsme feel to it (evil). Nice job.', '2007-09-26 09:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116885, 587430, 23484, '<td valign="top">Absolutely Fabulous.</td>', 'Absolutely Fabulous.', '2007-09-26 09:31:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116891, 588831, 63218, '<td valign="top">I was one of the "10" votes.  This shot rocks!  The title is perfect, too.  I like the energy, the offbeat crop, the way all elements support the ''flying.'' Especially I like the top/bottom crop, which for me adds to the high energy.  It brings me back to that exact same feeling I had as a kid (that we all did).</td>', 'I was one of the "10" votes.  This shot rocks!  The title is perfect, too.  I like the energy, the offbeat crop, the way all elements support the ''flying.'' Especially I like the top/bottom crop, which for me adds to the high energy.  It brings me back to that exact same feeling I had as a kid (that we all did).', '2007-09-26 09:33:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116910, 587430, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow, Les, this is awesome. Congratulations on your ribbon!!!</td>', 'Wow, Les, this is awesome. Congratulations on your ribbon!!!', '2007-09-26 09:41:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116921, 588680, 66384, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo. I think it would have done very well in Free Study.</td>', 'Terrific photo. I think it would have done very well in Free Study.', '2007-09-26 09:46:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116937, 587338, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I like the glow in the street light and the reflection on the windows. I also like the color. Very nice all the way around.</td>', 'Beautiful. I like the glow in the street light and the reflection on the windows. I also like the color. Very nice all the way around.', '2007-09-26 09:49:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116940, 588716, 11920, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9 thought it was a shriveled testacle.</td>', 'I gave this a 9 thought it was a shriveled testacle.', '2007-09-26 09:50:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116947, 588545, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love this composition and the color.</td>', 'I love this composition and the color.', '2007-09-26 09:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
