(4116960, 588879, 28710, '<td valign="top">looks good man, gratz on the first blue!</td>', 'looks good man, gratz on the first blue!', '2007-09-26 09:57:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116995, 588213, 83313, '<td valign="top">Responding to your post-mortem request more feedback on this:<br/> <br/>I think the sunrise glow and the two small figures in the water are competing for attention here. The horizon is also right in the middle, and my view is not steered to either subject. All the details are on the left side of the image.<br/> <br/>I''m going to go have a look at your other version that you said did not meet the challenge theme. (looks like you don''t have it posted. I''d love to see it, if possible.)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-26 09:16:39.</i></td>', 'Responding to your post-mortem request more feedback on this: I think the sunrise glow and the two small figures in the water are competing for attention here. The horizon is also right in the middle, and my view is not steered to either subject. All the details are on the left side of the image. I''m going to go have a look at your other version that you said did not meet the challenge theme. (looks like you don''t have it posted. I''d love to see it, if possible.)', '2007-09-26 10:15:05.000000', '2007-09-26 10:16:39.000000', 0),
(4117017, 588879, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Blue ribbon great image. :)</td>', 'Congratulations on your Blue ribbon great image. :)', '2007-09-26 10:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117025, 588806, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon I love this great shot. :)</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon I love this great shot. :)', '2007-09-26 10:24:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117044, 588760, 83313, '<td valign="top">I thought this was pretty good. Perhaps a little too much empty black space toward the bottom. Cropped a little more to the top might draw me to the subject more.</td>', 'I thought this was pretty good. Perhaps a little too much empty black space toward the bottom. Cropped a little more to the top might draw me to the subject more.', '2007-09-26 10:32:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117061, 588879, 39427, '<td valign="top">amazing pick man, congrats on your first ribbon!  you deserved one for a while</td>', 'amazing pick man, congrats on your first ribbon!  you deserved one for a while', '2007-09-26 10:36:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117069, 587082, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this one (obviously since I was one of your three 10''s).  Quite disappointed that it finished in 91st place with a 5.7.  Baaaaaaaaaad voters!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this one (obviously since I was one of your three 10''s).  Quite disappointed that it finished in 91st place with a 5.7.  Baaaaaaaaaad voters! ', '2007-09-26 10:37:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117099, 588213, 42171, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the comments gained after the "Post Mortem" thread.<br/> <br/>I will post my re-edit tonight when I go home in about 3 to 4 hours time... Here it is:<br/>Here is the edit...<br/> <br/><a href="//farm2.static.flickr.com/1119/1443715442_0b1cebeb3d_o.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm2.static.flickr.com/1119/1443715442_044a7794fb_m.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm2.static.flickr.com/1119/1443715442_044a7794fb_m.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm2.static.flickr.com/1119/1443715442_044a7794fb_m.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I think monitor calibration may be to blame here as there are actually 5 figures in the water, not 2 as <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">yospiff</a> commented on seeing!<br/> <br/>The sun was meant to be the main focus of the image, the figures in the water are an added intrest in the composition as I see it. I didn''t shoot it for the challenge, I was on holiday and wanted a sunset shot, this just managed to fit the "Silhouette" well with a bit of contrast/Brightness adjustment!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-26 12:35:54.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all of the comments gained after the "Post Mortem" thread. I will post my re-edit tonight when I go home in about 3 to 4 hours time... Here it is:Here is the edit...   I think monitor calibration may be to blame here as there are actually 5 figures in the water, not 2 as  yospiff commented on seeing! The sun was meant to be the main focus of the image, the figures in the water are an added intrest in the composition as I see it. I didn''t shoot it for the challenge, I was on holiday and wanted a sunset shot, this just managed to fit the "Silhouette" well with a bit of contrast/Brightness adjustment!', '2007-09-26 10:48:57.000000', '2007-09-26 13:35:54.000000', 0),
(4117103, 588806, 32581, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your win. You were coming closer &amp; closer to the ribbon for the past couple of challenges.</td>', 'Congrats on your win. You were coming closer & closer to the ribbon for the past couple of challenges.', '2007-09-26 10:50:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117111, 586531, 81783, '<td valign="top">Yes, the pelican is a statue modeled after a John James Audubon painting.  I was about 3 feet from the statue and 30 feet from the sidewalk that my family was walking on.  I thought about cropping out the pelican, but it was by definition, a "silhouette".  Then I looked above it''s head and the tree branches formed a heart shape.  I knew it probably would be picked on by some, but I still love the shot.  Maybe too busy, but a "silhouette".<br/> <br/>I have several other photos that I took for this competiton that might have scored higher, but the lighting on the tree and the family was too good not to share.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-26 09:54:14.</i></td>', 'Yes, the pelican is a statue modeled after a John James Audubon painting.  I was about 3 feet from the statue and 30 feet from the sidewalk that my family was walking on.  I thought about cropping out the pelican, but it was by definition, a "silhouette".  Then I looked above it''s head and the tree branches formed a heart shape.  I knew it probably would be picked on by some, but I still love the shot.  Maybe too busy, but a "silhouette". I have several other photos that I took for this competiton that might have scored higher, but the lighting on the tree and the family was too good not to share.', '2007-09-26 10:52:27.000000', '2007-09-26 10:54:14.000000', 0),
(4117121, 588879, 24454, '<td valign="top">I am so glad this won!  This photo wows me, touches me, and I''d hang it proudly on my wall!  CONGRATULATIONS!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am so glad this won!  This photo wows me, touches me, and I''d hang it proudly on my wall!  CONGRATULATIONS! ', '2007-09-26 10:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117126, 588806, 24454, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice for a red ribbon.  CONGRATULATIONS!  I''m sure it will be your first of many :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Excellent choice for a red ribbon.  CONGRATULATIONS!  I''m sure it will be your first of many :) ', '2007-09-26 10:57:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117129, 587430, 70661, '<td valign="top">Big congrats! Very beautiful shot!</td>', 'Big congrats! Very beautiful shot!', '2007-09-26 10:58:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117135, 587430, 24454, '<td valign="top">Thanks for upping my green with envy disorder about the 40D  :)  I''ve been eyeballing that one or the 5D for a while now.<br/> <br/>I have a feeling tho that it''s not your camera that won this ribbon, but your talent and your eye!  Congratulations!  I don''t think it''s a fluke and expect to see more ribbons from you in no time :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for upping my green with envy disorder about the 40D  :)  I''ve been eyeballing that one or the 5D for a while now. I have a feeling tho that it''s not your camera that won this ribbon, but your talent and your eye!  Congratulations!  I don''t think it''s a fluke and expect to see more ribbons from you in no time :) ', '2007-09-26 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117140, 587699, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a GORGEOUS PHOTO!  I am wild about photos that have the perspective/scale element in them.  This one is stunning!  Congratulations on 4th place and an honorable mention.<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a GORGEOUS PHOTO!  I am wild about photos that have the perspective/scale element in them.  This one is stunning!  Congratulations on 4th place and an honorable mention. ', '2007-09-26 11:02:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117144, 588574, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwwwwww. . . I missed this one somehow.  How precious!  Brilliantly executed!  Congratulations on a well-deserved honorable mention.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Awwwwwwwwww. . . I missed this one somehow.  How precious!  Brilliantly executed!  Congratulations on a well-deserved honorable mention. ', '2007-09-26 11:03:18.000000', NULL, 0);
