(4117207, 587457, 24454, '<td valign="top">Cory, WOW!!!!!!!!!  You''re going to make me want to go on vacation there if you keep this up!  :)   What a stunning photograph.  I much prefer the score your commenters gave this than the one the average [dumb] user gave it tho!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on exquisite photography.  And way to go creating the silver lining in being in a place you''d rather not be!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Cory, WOW!!!!!!!!!  You''re going to make me want to go on vacation there if you keep this up!  :)   What a stunning photograph.  I much prefer the score your commenters gave this than the one the average [dumb] user gave it tho! Congratulations on exquisite photography.  And way to go creating the silver lining in being in a place you''d rather not be! ', '2007-09-26 11:21:17.000000', NULL, 0),
