(4117249, 587702, 24454, '<td valign="top">It''s beautiful Andrija!  The voters are WEIRD sometimes!  I think this is much higher deserving than 5.9!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'It''s beautiful Andrija!  The voters are WEIRD sometimes!  I think this is much higher deserving than 5.9!!!! ', '2007-09-26 11:35:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117260, 588714, 30982, '<td valign="top">Given what I''ve seen of DPC tastes, I''d have expected this over 5.4 but perhaps not to a 6.  Statues are "easy" and often not well rewarded.  Also, there''s a bit of an outline of sorts around the silhouette - hard to tell what from.  Some may have seen it as an oversharpening artifact or some other element of processing.  And there are little lighter color spots in the sky, perhaps from lens flare/dust reflection - a smooth sky will be scored higher.</td>', 'Given what I''ve seen of DPC tastes, I''d have expected this over 5.4 but perhaps not to a 6.  Statues are "easy" and often not well rewarded.  Also, there''s a bit of an outline of sorts around the silhouette - hard to tell what from.  Some may have seen it as an oversharpening artifact or some other element of processing.  And there are little lighter color spots in the sky, perhaps from lens flare/dust reflection - a smooth sky will be scored higher.', '2007-09-26 11:40:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117263, 587583, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the subject!  I remember when voting on this one that when I scrolled down a bit, I liked it better.  The heavy clouds at the top seem just that - top-heavy.  There still is a lot of "dust" apparent on my monitor as well - this can lower a vote now that dust removal is allowed in basic.  (Mostly in the upper right, by the way, but a bit more along the underside of the clouds.  Easiest way to spot it is to really crank up the contrast in PS to see where it occurs.)</td>', 'Love the subject!  I remember when voting on this one that when I scrolled down a bit, I liked it better.  The heavy clouds at the top seem just that - top-heavy.  There still is a lot of "dust" apparent on my monitor as well - this can lower a vote now that dust removal is allowed in basic.  (Mostly in the upper right, by the way, but a bit more along the underside of the clouds.  Easiest way to spot it is to really crank up the contrast in PS to see where it occurs.)', '2007-09-26 11:44:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117264, 588702, 69368, '<td valign="top">Leisha, this pic is wonderful! Love the crop, the colors, the cat, the view out of the window, the title....!<br/>Was one of my favorite pics in this challenge!<br/>I also think it''s underrated!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-26 10:45:10.</i></td>', 'Leisha, this pic is wonderful! Love the crop, the colors, the cat, the view out of the window, the title....!Was one of my favorite pics in this challenge!I also think it''s underrated!', '2007-09-26 11:44:32.000000', '2007-09-26 11:45:10.000000', 0),
(4117269, 587401, 73235, '<td valign="top">gave you a 7, for creativity and the unusual silhouette.<br/>I have to admit the outtake with the birds on the branches would have scored much better. But WTH I am experimenting a lot myself and bet voted down with some of them. Don''t give up and don''t be frustrated</td>', 'gave you a 7, for creativity and the unusual silhouette.I have to admit the outtake with the birds on the branches would have scored much better. But WTH I am experimenting a lot myself and bet voted down with some of them. Don''t give up and don''t be frustrated', '2007-09-26 11:45:37.000000', NULL, 0),
