(4117283, 588847, 30982, '<td valign="top">I liked this one just fine.  I thought it a very good technical execution of the challenge (ie a very good silhouette) and I like your subject choice - and I love the tendrils!  You may want to try a different crop - take away the tree and let the plant exist on its own and see if you like it.</td>', 'I liked this one just fine.  I thought it a very good technical execution of the challenge (ie a very good silhouette) and I like your subject choice - and I love the tendrils!  You may want to try a different crop - take away the tree and let the plant exist on its own and see if you like it.', '2007-09-26 11:49:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117284, 588255, 69368, '<td valign="top">Henk-Jan, this pic was one of my favorites in this challenge! It''s underrated, IMO</td>', 'Henk-Jan, this pic was one of my favorites in this challenge! It''s underrated, IMO', '2007-09-26 11:49:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117296, 588545, 43565, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I love the sun reflecting!</td>', 'Very nice!  I love the sun reflecting!', '2007-09-26 11:53:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117303, 587401, 30982, '<td valign="top">Your score is most likely because most voters don''t see this as a silhouette, and are instead expecting little to no detail in the subject.  This is, however, an excellent and different perspective of a bird in flight, and the light outlining the wings is quite lovely.</td>', 'Your score is most likely because most voters don''t see this as a silhouette, and are instead expecting little to no detail in the subject.  This is, however, an excellent and different perspective of a bird in flight, and the light outlining the wings is quite lovely.', '2007-09-26 11:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117314, 586832, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good color (and a color set popular here at DPC).  A pretty good composition, with nice negative space at the top and a pretty well balanced bottom third.  I think part of what hurt you was the confusion as to what the critter was.  For DPC-simple, yes, crop the shrub.  In Deb''s book of Mediocre Photography, keep the shrub - adds balance, context and scale.</td>', 'Very good color (and a color set popular here at DPC).  A pretty good composition, with nice negative space at the top and a pretty well balanced bottom third.  I think part of what hurt you was the confusion as to what the critter was.  For DPC-simple, yes, crop the shrub.  In Deb''s book of Mediocre Photography, keep the shrub - adds balance, context and scale.', '2007-09-26 12:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117321, 588399, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''m with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=24454" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">SandyP</a>.  You wuz robbed.  I love the perfect crescent framing the sun.  The translucence makes a welcome change from the plain, black silhouettes.</td>', 'I''m with  SandyP.  You wuz robbed.  I love the perfect crescent framing the sun.  The translucence makes a welcome change from the plain, black silhouettes.', '2007-09-26 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117329, 588831, 42198, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. It really conveys a sense of movement, you can almost feel him jumping in the air, and the effect of motion blur on his hands works really well. The crop, composition and angle really add to this.<br/> <br/>I love the grain and the tone in the background as well.</td>', 'I love this shot. It really conveys a sense of movement, you can almost feel him jumping in the air, and the effect of motion blur on his hands works really well. The crop, composition and angle really add to this. I love the grain and the tone in the background as well.', '2007-09-26 12:10:19.000000', NULL, 0),
