(4117607, 588574, 34562, '<td valign="top">Very Very cute idea. It was my Blue Ribbon photo also. I love the little flick of hair on the girl. (The girl that looks like a girl) What a treat to have such great models!!</td>', 'Very Very cute idea. It was my Blue Ribbon photo also. I love the little flick of hair on the girl. (The girl that looks like a girl) What a treat to have such great models!!', '2007-09-26 14:08:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117613, 588727, 66952, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I think what hurt your score the most was the post processing on the sky. The contrast in the sky has been increased so much that it''s really posterized (the banding and blobbiness). The increase in contrast also caused the noise in the dark part of the sky to really show up.  The sky in your outtake is quite a bit better. <br/> <br/>Hope this helps.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I think what hurt your score the most was the post processing on the sky. The contrast in the sky has been increased so much that it''s really posterized (the banding and blobbiness). The increase in contrast also caused the noise in the dark part of the sky to really show up.  The sky in your outtake is quite a bit better.  Hope this helps.', '2007-09-26 14:10:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117618, 588760, 66952, '<td valign="top">It''s a good start. The main problem is that not much of him is visible. If there were more horizon, so we could see all (or at least most) of him, I think you''d have a really good shot.</td>', 'It''s a good start. The main problem is that not much of him is visible. If there were more horizon, so we could see all (or at least most) of him, I think you''d have a really good shot.', '2007-09-26 14:12:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117628, 588702, 44877, '<td valign="top">This should have scored AT LEAST in the top 20, if not better. Absolutely beautiful and inspired. The cat''s pose is outstanding, colors, clarity, and the title is very cute. All the commenters loved it - so who knows what happened... Just know that you have a winner here, even if it didn''t get the "other" ribbon. :o)</td>', 'This should have scored AT LEAST in the top 20, if not better. Absolutely beautiful and inspired. The cat''s pose is outstanding, colors, clarity, and the title is very cute. All the commenters loved it - so who knows what happened... Just know that you have a winner here, even if it didn''t get the "other" ribbon. :o)', '2007-09-26 14:14:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117629, 588312, 68504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The Small Screen does not do justice to the subtlety of your lighting and colour.  Classic composition taken further into its essence in modern unpretentious way.</td>', 'Beautiful. The Small Screen does not do justice to the subtlety of your lighting and colour.  Classic composition taken further into its essence in modern unpretentious way.', '2007-09-26 14:14:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117630, 587583, 66952, '<td valign="top">Of all the ones in the post mortem thread who are questioning their scores, I think this is the one I would choose as being underrated. I think it''s a lovely image. Maybe the noise in the sky or the halos around the plane hurt the score. Not sure.</td>', 'Of all the ones in the post mortem thread who are questioning their scores, I think this is the one I would choose as being underrated. I think it''s a lovely image. Maybe the noise in the sky or the halos around the plane hurt the score. Not sure.', '2007-09-26 14:15:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117639, 588831, 65319, '<td valign="top">I love the expression of movement captured so artistically in this photo!   Hmmm...technically, I do see a halo around your silhouette which is an issue I always struggle with as well in my own photos and usually I have to fiddle with my sharpening technique to get a really clean silhouette!</td>', 'I love the expression of movement captured so artistically in this photo!   Hmmm...technically, I do see a halo around your silhouette which is an issue I always struggle with as well in my own photos and usually I have to fiddle with my sharpening technique to get a really clean silhouette!', '2007-09-26 14:19:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117663, 586867, 44877, '<td valign="top">Very unique idea and great execution. I totally love this. Congrats on the good score.</td>', 'Very unique idea and great execution. I totally love this. Congrats on the good score.', '2007-09-26 14:26:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117667, 588657, 44877, '<td valign="top">I absolutely adore this photo. It''s so otherworldly and makes me want to be a goose on that grass. This should have scored tons and tons higher.</td>', 'I absolutely adore this photo. It''s so otherworldly and makes me want to be a goose on that grass. This should have scored tons and tons higher.', '2007-09-26 14:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117748, 587617, 35357, '<td valign="top">Wow, an underrated shot.  I was just flipping through them in order of finish and there are so many beautiful shots.  Maybe I just have a thing for silhouettes I wasn''t aware of.  I hit your shot just now and it it stopped me in my tracks.  Looked down &amp; saw your name.  Love it.</td>', 'Wow, an underrated shot.  I was just flipping through them in order of finish and there are so many beautiful shots.  Maybe I just have a thing for silhouettes I wasn''t aware of.  I hit your shot just now and it it stopped me in my tracks.  Looked down & saw your name.  Love it.', '2007-09-26 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117795, 588879, 79741, '<td valign="top">beautiful....</td>', 'beautiful....', '2007-09-26 15:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117854, 588213, 83313, '<td valign="top">I agree with Annpatt, the re-edit is nicer, and I think it still totally qualifies as a silhouette. In fact, it is a little unique in that it has several separate silhouttes within the image: The skyline against the sunset, and the people in the water.</td>', 'I agree with Annpatt, the re-edit is nicer, and I think it still totally qualifies as a silhouette. In fact, it is a little unique in that it has several separate silhouttes within the image: The skyline against the sunset, and the people in the water.', '2007-09-26 15:32:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117872, 588772, 59267, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the comments and votes. you guys are absolutely right. It''s not northern light, aurora is usually curvy. I took this photo at the WESTERN land ends of San Francisco located WESTERN of USA. You may call it western light if you like. lol.<br/>The subjects are the vestige of ancient times and that''s how I name it.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the comments and votes. you guys are absolutely right. It''s not northern light, aurora is usually curvy. I took this photo at the WESTERN land ends of San Francisco located WESTERN of USA. You may call it western light if you like. lol.The subjects are the vestige of ancient times and that''s how I name it.', '2007-09-26 15:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4117879, 588657, 27373, '<td valign="top">Should''ve stuck with Deer  :)<br/> <br/>This is a fabulous photo.  I have a feeling you got knocked down because many people didn''t perceive this to be a true silhouette.<br/> <br/>I say knocked down, but I''d kill- okay maybe not kill, maybe throw a tantrum, to get 44 votes of 8+.</td>', 'Should''ve stuck with Deer  :) This is a fabulous photo.  I have a feeling you got knocked down because many people didn''t perceive this to be a true silhouette. I say knocked down, but I''d kill- okay maybe not kill, maybe throw a tantrum, to get 44 votes of 8+.', '2007-09-26 15:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4118040, 588941, 66494, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I wish I''d have voted on this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot. I wish I''d have voted on this challenge.', '2007-09-26 17:10:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4118057, 588879, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sean on your first ribbon and PB, and it''s a lovely blue!  This is a great silhouette shot so you deserve all the accolades.</td>', 'Congratulations Sean on your first ribbon and PB, and it''s a lovely blue!  This is a great silhouette shot so you deserve all the accolades.', '2007-09-26 17:18:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4118103, 587430, 49804, '<td valign="top">congratulations les, first shot with the 40d, and a very nice one, and a ribbon, great job</td>', 'congratulations les, first shot with the 40d, and a very nice one, and a ribbon, great job', '2007-09-26 17:35:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4118118, 586832, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the silhouette needs to be a really crystal clear line - no vignette at all, for a silhouette to be completely effective. I think with the owl on one side and the bush on the other, despite what could be balance, it almost loses the impact of both.  I would crop out the bush all together.  Not have the owl centered, but make sure that the focus is tack sharp so that the line created by the shadow against the background gives no margin for error.  Hope this helps!!!<br/> <br/>:~D</td>', 'I think the silhouette needs to be a really crystal clear line - no vignette at all, for a silhouette to be completely effective. I think with the owl on one side and the bush on the other, despite what could be balance, it almost loses the impact of both.  I would crop out the bush all together.  Not have the owl centered, but make sure that the focus is tack sharp so that the line created by the shadow against the background gives no margin for error.  Hope this helps!!! :~D', '2007-09-26 17:41:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4118162, 588444, 35669, '<td valign="top">the best in the challenge for me.</td>', 'the best in the challenge for me.', '2007-09-26 17:53:53.000000', NULL, 0),
