(4118277, 587512, 42567, '<td valign="top">Nice job Judi!  Congratulations on the top 20.  Awesome job as always.</td>', 'Nice job Judi!  Congratulations on the top 20.  Awesome job as always.', '2007-09-26 18:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4118322, 588420, 71931, '<td valign="top">Birds fly where and when they fly; I can''t control the sky.  Settings were for something else; the ducks just flew up out of nowhere and I pointed and clicked; I was surprised the shot was as good as it was, under those conditions.  Granted, comments are valid, as far as they go, especially the one about the sensor dust, which I just did not see, but generally show no understanding or appreciation for wildlife.  If a cosmetic blemish is more important than the subject, something is dramatically wrong.  I think I''m wasting my time in here, to be honest.  I''ll just go back to taking shots that please me, without worrying about pleasing anyone else, on a fake schedule such as this site requires.  In short, as President Abraham Lincoln put it, "People who like this sort of thing will find this the sort of thing they like."</td>', 'Birds fly where and when they fly; I can''t control the sky.  Settings were for something else; the ducks just flew up out of nowhere and I pointed and clicked; I was surprised the shot was as good as it was, under those conditions.  Granted, comments are valid, as far as they go, especially the one about the sensor dust, which I just did not see, but generally show no understanding or appreciation for wildlife.  If a cosmetic blemish is more important than the subject, something is dramatically wrong.  I think I''m wasting my time in here, to be honest.  I''ll just go back to taking shots that please me, without worrying about pleasing anyone else, on a fake schedule such as this site requires.  In short, as President Abraham Lincoln put it, "People who like this sort of thing will find this the sort of thing they like."', '2007-09-26 18:54:35.000000', NULL, 0),
