(4118861, 586832, 66597, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a great entry - I was one of your 7''s. I love owls and his silhouette is striking. I had no trouble figuring out what it is, but then again I photograph owls a lot so may be more familiar with their shape than most. Maybe it could be a little better compositionally if there wasn''t so much space between the shrub and the owl, but I doubt you could exactly ask him to move a little to the left :-)</td>', 'I thought this was a great entry - I was one of your 7''s. I love owls and his silhouette is striking. I had no trouble figuring out what it is, but then again I photograph owls a lot so may be more familiar with their shape than most. Maybe it could be a little better compositionally if there wasn''t so much space between the shrub and the owl, but I doubt you could exactly ask him to move a little to the left :-)', '2007-09-26 22:47:15.000000', NULL, 0),
