(4526563, 588312, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful and unusual photograph this is. I love the lines and color. Beautiful lighting. I''m so glad I stumbled across it.</td>', 'What a beautiful and unusual photograph this is. I love the lines and color. Beautiful lighting. I''m so glad I stumbled across it.', '2008-02-28 22:05:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4533686, 588381, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is sweet!  I think that if you had plenty of light to shoot it then it would not have made such an interesting shot.  That''s a beautiful boat.</td>', 'This is sweet!  I think that if you had plenty of light to shoot it then it would not have made such an interesting shot.  That''s a beautiful boat.', '2008-03-02 22:50:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4550124, 588147, 90495, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this finished 172. Yes, many will think it''s underexposed but if they read the description I''m sure they would think differently. Also, I think the lens glare at the top made people think it was actually the sun.<br/> <br/>Beautifully done with good timing and patience.<br/> <br/>I can''t wait for the next silhouette challenge.</td>', 'I can''t believe this finished 172. Yes, many will think it''s underexposed but if they read the description I''m sure they would think differently. Also, I think the lens glare at the top made people think it was actually the sun. Beautifully done with good timing and patience. I can''t wait for the next silhouette challenge.', '2008-03-09 14:04:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4577011, 587457, 63267, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors.  I love the helos coming in, it adds a whole nother dimension to this photo.  The silhouette is perfect as is the rest of the photo.  Brilliant!</td>', 'Stunning colors.  I love the helos coming in, it adds a whole nother dimension to this photo.  The silhouette is perfect as is the rest of the photo.  Brilliant!', '2008-03-20 13:58:16.000000', NULL, 0),
