(5187547, 588232, 10985, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, color and mood. I too like the glow of this.<br/> <br/>In fact, "travail du fer" means "work of the iron". Wrought iron, as the final product, is called "fer forgé". :)</td>', 'Lovely light, color and mood. I too like the glow of this. In fact, "travail du fer" means "work of the iron". Wrought iron, as the final product, is called "fer forgé". :)', '2009-01-12 16:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5219760, 588381, 29748, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!</td>', 'This is beautiful!', '2009-01-26 09:39:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5225679, 588879, 30807, '<td valign="top">You know - looking back, it''s like the cowboy is looking at the streak of light, and it could presage a Heavenly encounter, or be a shooting star, or something with a spiritual connection, so that the lateness of the day, and the darkening, are shot through by the promise of the light to come. <br/> <br/>What a marvellous co-incidence (except I don''t think there are that many co-incidences, rather connections, and this is such an connection)<br/> <br/>Sorry to hear about the sad news - Best Regards<br/> <br/>Adrian</td>', 'You know - looking back, it''s like the cowboy is looking at the streak of light, and it could presage a Heavenly encounter, or be a shooting star, or something with a spiritual connection, so that the lateness of the day, and the darkening, are shot through by the promise of the light to come.  What a marvellous co-incidence (except I don''t think there are that many co-incidences, rather connections, and this is such an connection) Sorry to hear about the sad news - Best Regards Adrian', '2009-01-29 05:31:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5226411, 588574, 16230, '<td valign="top">A great concept well executed!</td>', 'A great concept well executed!', '2009-01-29 17:51:43.000000', NULL, 0),
